OL,3,ASex offender bailed to flat near
OL,4,Aplayground
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sex offender jailed for taking
OL,7,Fthousands of pictures of children and
OL,8,Fusing AI software to "nudify" them was
OL,9,Frepeatedly allowed to return to his
OL,10,Fhome overlooking the playground he
OL,11,Ftargeted.
OL,13,FIt meant victims of Zafer Dogan, from
OL,14,FEnfield in north London, were living
OL,15,Fclose to the 32-year-old, who admitted
OL,16,Fmultiple offences.
