OL,5,
OL,6,FMet Police Commissioner Sir Mark Rowley
OL,7,Fspoke outside Wood Green Crown Court
OL,8,Fafter Dogan was jailed for two years
OL,9,Fand four months, where Sir Mark
OL,10,Fcriticised the "unfathomable decisions"
OL,11,Fof the justice system.
OL,13,F"The children should be put first, not
OL,14,Fthe paedophile," he said.
